<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Horizon Core | Enterprise-Grade Blockchain</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg-color: #0d1117;
            --panel-bg: rgba(22, 27, 34, 0.85); /* شفافیت برای دیده شدن پس‌زمینه */
            --border-color: #30363d;
            --text-main: #c9d1d9;
            --text-muted: #8b949e;
            --accent: #58a6ff;
            --accent-green: #3fb950;
        }
        
        body { 
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif; 
            color: var(--text-main); 
            margin: 0; 
            padding: 40px 20px; 
            line-height: 1.6; 
            background-color: var(--bg-color);
            /* تنظیمات مربوط به لوگو به عنوان پس‌زمینه */
            background-image: url('logo.png');
            background-repeat: no-repeat;
            background-position: center center;
            background-attachment: fixed;
            background-size: 50%; /* اندازه لوگو در پس‌زمینه */
            background-blend-mode: overlay;
        }

        /* پوشش تیره برای اینکه متن‌ها روی لوگو کاملاً خوانا باشند */
        .overlay {
            position: fixed;
            top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0;
            background: rgba(13, 17, 23, 0.85); /* لایه تیره با شفافیت 85 درصد */
            z-index: -1;
        }

        .container { max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; position: relative; z-index: 1; }
        
        /* استایل بخش‌های جداگانه */
        .section { 
            background: var(--panel-bg); 
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color); 
            border-radius: 12px; 
            padding: 30px; 
            margin-bottom: 30px; 
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px); /* افکت شیشه‌ای برای خوانایی بهتر */
            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
        }

        .header-section { text-align: center; border-bottom: 2px solid var(--accent); }
        .header-section h1 { color: #fff; font-size: 38px; margin-bottom: 5px; letter-spacing: 2px; }
        .header-section h2 { color: var(--accent); font-size: 20px; font-weight: normal; margin-top: 0; }
        .founder-info { margin-top: 15px; color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 14px; }

        h3 { color: var(--accent-green); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color); padding-bottom: 10px; margin-top: 0; }
        
        .grid-2 { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 20px; }
        .btn { 
            display: inline-block; padding: 15px 25px; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold; 
            text-decoration: none; border-radius: 8px; text-align: center; transition: 0.3s;
            margin-top: 15px;
        }
        .btn-primary { background: var(--accent-green); color: #fff; border: 2px solid #2ea043; }
        .btn-primary:hover { background: #2ea043; transform: translateY(-2px); }
        .btn-secondary { background: transparent; color: var(--accent); border: 2px solid var(--accent); }
        .btn-secondary:hover { background: var(--accent); color: #fff; transform: translateY(-2px); }
        
        .terminal { background: #000; padding: 15px; border-radius: 8px; font-family: monospace; color: var(--accent-green); font-size: 14px; white-space: pre-wrap; border: 1px solid var(--border-color); }
        
        .legal-box { background: #1f242d; border-left: 4px solid #d29922; padding: 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 14px; }
        
        .contact-list { list-style: none; padding: 0; }
        .contact-list li { margin-bottom: 15px; }
        .contact-list a { color: var(--accent); text-decoration: none; font-weight: bold; font-size: 16px; }
        .contact-list a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }

        @media (max-width: 768px) { .grid-2 { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="overlay"></div> <!-- لایه تیره برای خوانایی -->

    <div class="container">

        <!-- بخش ۱: هویت برند و مشخصات -->
        <div class="section header-section">
            <h1>HORIZON CORE</h1>
            <h2>Offline-First Tamper-Evident Ledger</h2>
            <div class="founder-info">
                <strong>Founder & Authorized Signatory:</strong> Mahdi Amolimoghaddam
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- بخش ۲: معماری و قابلیت‌ها -->
        <div class="section">
            <h3>🏗️ System Architecture & Capabilities</h3>
            <div class="grid-2">
                <div>
                    <ul style="list-style-type: none; padding-left: 0;">
                        <li>✅ <strong>Multi-Node Consensus:</strong> 7-Node Horizon Angel Network</li>
                        <li>✅ <strong>Fully Offline:</strong> Air-Gap ready deployment</li>
                        <li>✅ <strong>Fail-Closed:</strong> Halts on any security failure</li>
                        <li>✅ <strong>Deterministic:</strong> RFC 6979 secp256k1 signatures</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
                <div class="terminal">
$ ./verify_architecture.sh
[1] 7 Nodes Consensus: IDENTICAL law_hash
[2] Security Test: SQLi BLOCKED (400)
[3] Security Test: Auth Bypass BLOCKED (401)
🚀 REAL TPS: 348,432 | 199 Vectors Blocked</div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- بخش ۳: دسترسی تجاری و تریال (مهم برای مشتری) -->
        <div class="section">
            <h3>🚀 Get Started (Trial & Commercial)</h3>
            <p>Evaluate Horizon Core or request an enterprise license through our official channels:</p>
            <div class="grid-2">
                <div>
                    <p><strong>Evaluate the System:</strong></p>
                    <a href="https://github.com/beaconchain-horizon/horizon-core/releases/tag/trial-v1.4-release" class="btn btn-secondary" target="_blank">📦 Download Trial Package (19.3 MB)</a>
                    <p style="font-size: 12px; color: var(--text-muted); margin-top: 5px;">Includes real ECDSA-signed license (1M TX / 4 Days)</p>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <p><strong>Place a Commercial Order:</strong></p>
                    <a href="https://experts.godaddy.com/mahdi-amolimoghaddam?ref=submittable" class="btn btn-primary" target="_blank">🛡️ Order via Verified GoDaddy Portal</a>
                    <p style="font-size: 12px; color: var(--text-muted); margin-top: 5px;">Official, legally binding US partner portal</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- بخش ۴: سند حقوقی و قوانین اروپا -->
        <div class="section">
            <h3>⚖️ Commercial License & EU Compliance</h3>
            <div class="legal-box">
                <strong>Copyright (c) 2026 Horizon Angel. All Rights Reserved.</strong><br>
                This source code is proprietary and confidential. No part of this code may be reproduced, distributed, or transmitted in any form or by any means, without prior written permission.<br><br>
                <strong>GDPR & SCC Compliance:</strong> Horizon Core is designed as an Offline-First, Air-Gapped ledger. The Licensor does not collect any personal data (PII). The Licensee remains the sole Data Controller, fully compliant with EU GDPR and Standard Contractual Clauses (SCC).
            </div>
            <p style="font-size: 13px; color: var(--text-muted); margin-top: 10px;">
                * For the complete End User License Agreement (EULA), please refer to the signed document provided during enterprise onboarding.
            </p>
        </div>

        <!-- بخش ۵: اطلاعات تماس -->
        <div class="section">
            <h3>📞 Contact & Official Links</h3>
            <ul class="contact-list">
                <li>✉️ <strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:financialfeemore.amoli@gmail.com">financialfeemore.amoli@gmail.com</a></li>
                <li>🌐 <strong>Public Documentation:</strong> <a href="https://github.com/beaconchain-horizon/beaconchain-horizon" target="_blank">github.com/beaconchain-horizon</a></li>
                <li>🛡️ <strong>Verified Partner Portal:</strong> <a href="https://experts.godaddy.com/mahdi-amolimoghaddam?ref=submittable" target="_blank">GoDaddy Experts Profile</a></li>
            </ul>
        </div>

    </div>
</body>
</html>
